msgstr "voix de l'IA"

#: u_resourcestring.sallrightwewillbeontime
msgid "All right, we'll be on time."
msgstr "Très bien, nous serons à l'heure."

#: u_resourcestring.sandtheyusevolcanolavaasrawmaterial
msgid "And they use the volcano's lava as a raw material..."
msgstr "Et ils se servent de la lave du volcan comme matière première..."

#: u_resourcestring.sandyouweresinging
msgid "And you sang at the top of your lungs! Hahaha!"
msgstr "Et toi tu chantais à tue-tête! Hahaha!"

#: u_resourcestring.sansdcardiwilltakeit
msgid "an SD card... I'll take it, it might come in handy."
msgstr "une carte SD... Je la prend, ça pourrai m'être utile."

#: u_resourcestring.sarcademode
msgid "ARCADE MODE"
msgstr "MODE ARCADE"

#: u_resourcestring.sareyougoingtohelpmenow
msgid "Are you going to help me now?"
msgstr "Vas-tu m'aider maintenant ?"

#: u_resourcestring.sasyouwishbutithink
msgid "As you wish, but I think we'll see you soon hihihi!"
msgstr "Comme tu voudras, mais je pense qu'on se reverra bientôt hihihi!"

#: u_resourcestring.satrain
msgid "A train!?"
msgstr "Un train !?"

#: u_resourcestring.sback
