msgstr "RETOUR"

#: u_resourcestring.sbacktomap
msgid "BACK TO MAP"
msgstr "RETOUR A LA CARTE"

#: u_resourcestring.sbacktosam
msgid "BACK TO SAM"
msgstr "RETOUR CHEZ SAM"

#: u_resourcestring.sbecauseyouhaveboughtitems
msgid "Because you've bought items from me, you're entitled to a free bonus: I'm giving you the power to teleport anywhere on the map simply by clicking on the place you want to go. Isn't that nice?!"
msgstr "Parce que tu m'as acheter des articles, tu as droit à un bonus gratuit:  je te donne le pouvoir de te téléporter n'importe où sur la carte simplement en cliquant sur le lieu ou tu veux aller. C'est pas bien ça ?!"

#: u_resourcestring.sbeforeileaveihavetosearchallcratesinthearea
msgid "Before I leave, I have to search all the crates in the area."
msgstr "Avant de quitter, je dois fouiller toutes les caisses des environs."

#: u_resourcestring.sbowexplanation
msgid "your bow"
msgstr "votre arc"

#: u_resourcestring.sbowupgradehint
msgctxt "u_resourcestring.sbowupgradehint"
msgid "increase arrow speed, decrease bow reloading time"
msgstr "augmente la vitesse des flèches, diminue le temps de rechargement de l'arc"

#: u_resourcestring.sbuild
msgid "BUILD"
msgstr "FABRIQUER"

#: u_resourcestring.sbusinessisbusiness
msgid "Business is Business. Hihihi..."
msgstr "Les affaires sont les affaires. Hihihi..."

#: u_resourcestring.sbuthurryitsreallyurgent
msgid "But hurry, it's really urgent, I've rarely seen my parents so worried."
msgstr "Mais fais vite, il y a vraiment urgence, j'ai rarement vu mes parents si inquiets."

#: u_resourcestring.sbutwhataboutyourrobots
msgid "What about your robots? Don't you mind losing them?"
msgstr "Et tes robots ? ça ne te fait rien de les perdre ?"

#: u_resourcestring.sbuy
msgid "BUY"
msgstr "ACHETER"

#: u_resourcestring.sbuyequipment
msgid "buy new equipment in the workshop"
msgstr "achète de nouveaux équipements dans ton atelier"

#: u_resourcestring.sbuythehammer
