msgstr "Oui"

#: u_resourcestring.syesasitoldyouialways
msgid "Yes, as I told you, I always keep my word."
msgstr "Oui, comme je te l'ai dit, je tiens toujours parole."

#: u_resourcestring.syesirememberwell
msgid "Yes, I remember well, he always took his guitar and played music for us."
msgstr "Oui je me souviens bien, il prenait toujours sa guitare et nous jouait de la musique."

#: u_resourcestring.syesitseasyijumpinyourarms
msgid "Yees! Now you are my friend and I want to give you a big hug!"
msgstr "Ouiii! Maintenant tu es mon amie et je veux te faire un gros câlin!"

#: u_resourcestring.syesthatswhativaguelyheard
